  "prefLabel": "Rev 311.01 Availability of Forms and Returns",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 311.01 Availability of Forms and Returns. All business profits tax forms may be obtained:\n\n(a) Online at www.revenue.nh.gov;\n\n(b) By calling the telephone forms line at 603-230-5001; or\n\n(c) By writing to:\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Revenue Administration\n\nTaxpayer Services Division\n\nP.O. Box 637\n\nConcord, NH 03302-0637.\n\nSource. #5490, eff 10-19-92; ss by #6853, eff 9-23-98; rpld by #8709, eff 8-25-06\n\nNew. #8709, eff 8-25-06 (from Rev 311.02); ss by #10758, eff 1-16-15; ss by #14231, eff 4-3-25, EXPIRES 4-3-35",
